abstract: >-
  Interactive calculator for AI agent reliability, calibrated on 131,332 agent runs across
  four public benchmarks (Terminal-Bench 2.0/2.1/4.0, SWE-bench Lite samples) plus 74
  tau-bench measurements. Shows that verifier blind spots cap chain reliability and that
  correlated retries buy far less than 1-(1-p)^k suggests.
